  "type": "multipleCorrect",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Consider a uniform spherical charge distribution of radius <math><msub><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> centred at the origin O. In this distribution, a spherical cavity of radius <math><msub><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> , centred at <math><mi>P</mi></math> with distance <math><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> (see figure) is made. If the electric field inside the cavity at position <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math> is <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>)</mo></math> , then the correct statement(s) is (are)<br ><br/><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/image18-07506da8-54cf-4f56-a9c8-b2c108606352.jpg\"/></p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "tJhlI",
      "text": "<math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math>  is uniform, its magnitude is independent of  <math><msub><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math>  but its direction depends on  <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "OgUfg",
      "text": "<math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math>  is uniform, its magnitude is depends on  <math><msub><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math>  and its direction depends on  <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "sSMR4",
      "text": "<math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math>  is uniform, its magnitude is dependent of a but its direction depends on  <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "T6PhA",
      "text": "<math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math>  is uniform and both its magnitude and direction depend on  <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
